{"id": 218392028, "slug": "there-are-bonds-in-the-singularity", "title": "There Are Bonds in the Singularity", "subtitle": "Bonds vs stocks as NYC vs SF", "post_date": "2026-10-01T20:28:12.850Z", "audience": "everyone", "wordcount": 1392, "reaction_count": 94, "comment_count": 0, "restacks": 4, "reactions": {"\u2764": 94}, "body_html": "<p>It\u2019s gonna take us a little while to get back in the swing of markets here folks, so rather than jump right into a full portfolio, we\u2019re going to reboot the world view more or less asset by asset. To show not just what the view is, but how we put views together, at various levels of confidence.</p><p>Right now there are two big themes dominating everyone\u2019s world view, the second being more or less the counter to the first.</p><p>The first being FOOM.</p><p>The SF idea that yes, we are somewhere in the singularity, yes things are about to get weird, and as a corollary, yes you pretty much want to be buying any and all compute that isn\u2019t tied down right now.</p><p>The second, call it the NYC idea, is that ugh, the nasty combo of</p><p>a) a massive demand for capital to build all that compute</p><p>b) the inflationary impact of conflict, and</p><p>c) the death of the neoliberal consensus</p><p>is doing terrible, awful, despicable things to bonds.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!nq55!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F807d3e2b-03c1-4e34-86da-7d60681ce5d4_2808x1542.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!nq55!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F807d3e2b-03c1-4e34-86da-7d60681ce5d4_2808x1542.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!nq55!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F807d3e2b-03c1-4e34-86da-7d60681ce5d4_2808x1542.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!nq55!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F807d3e2b-03c1-4e34-86da-7d60681ce5d4_2808x1542.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!nq55!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F807d3e2b-03c1-4e34-86da-7d60681ce5d4_2808x1542.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!nq55!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F807d3e2b-03c1-4e34-86da-7d60681ce5d4_2808x1542.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"800\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/807d3e2b-03c1-4e34-86da-7d60681ce5d4_2808x1542.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:800,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:90793,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://www.campbellramble.ai/i/218392028?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F807d3e2b-03c1-4e34-86da-7d60681ce5d4_2808x1542.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!nq55!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F807d3e2b-03c1-4e34-86da-7d60681ce5d4_2808x1542.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!nq55!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F807d3e2b-03c1-4e34-86da-7d60681ce5d4_2808x1542.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!nq55!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F807d3e2b-03c1-4e34-86da-7d60681ce5d4_2808x1542.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!nq55!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F807d3e2b-03c1-4e34-86da-7d60681ce5d4_2808x1542.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>The consequence of which, as we have covered previously, is pulling discount rates UP, which in turn drags DOWN the net present value of any cashflow priced into the future.</p><div class=\"digest-post-embed\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;nodeId&quot;:&quot;49a560c2-fcdb-4112-ab82-4f9d02c3a7da&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;cta&quot;:null,&quot;showBylines&quot;:true,&quot;showDescription&quot;:true,&quot;showImage&quot;:true,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;sm&quot;,&quot;isEditorNode&quot;:true,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;There Are Bonds in the Semiconductors&quot;,&quot;publishedBylines&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:27115489,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Alexander Campbell&quot;,&quot;bio&quot;:&quot;Founder @Rose.AI\\nPreviously at Bridgewater, Lehman. &quot;,&quot;photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/615b2fcd-98b6-4beb-89b3-cc56ac17c33c_400x400.jpeg&quot;,&quot;is_guest&quot;:false,&quot;bestseller_tier&quot;:null}],&quot;post_date&quot;:&quot;2026-05-20T05:35:31.461Z&quot;,&quot;cover_image&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3hy1!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe0cb7c84-9c0b-4662-b62a-4e97485b6815_1653x932.png&quot;,&quot;cover_image_alt&quot;:null,&quot;cover_image_crop&quot;:null,&quot;canonical_url&quot;:&quot;https://www.campbellramble.ai/p/there-are-bonds-in-the-semiconductors&quot;,&quot;section_name&quot;:null,&quot;video_upload_id&quot;:null,&quot;id&quot;:198504913,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;newsletter&quot;,&quot;reaction_count&quot;:176,&quot;comment_count&quot;:20,&quot;publication_id&quot;:312411,&quot;publication_name&quot;:&quot;Campbell Ramble&quot;,&quot;publi